# =============================================================================
# AEROCAST NCR - Environment Configuration Overview
# =============================================================================
#
# AEROCAST NCR consists of two decoupled services:
#
# 1. Backend Service (FastAPI):
#    Location: api/.env
#    Template: api/.env.example
#    Quick start:
#      cd api
#      copy .env.example .env    # On Linux/macOS: cp .env.example .env
#    Key variables:
#      - AQ_API_KEY: OpenAQ v3 API key (Free: https://explore.openaq.org/register)
#      - DATABASE_URL: PostgreSQL + PostGIS connection string (optional; SQLite fallback)
#      - OLLAMA_BASE_URL: Ollama endpoint for AI assistant & KB embeddings (default: http://localhost:11434)
#      - CORS_ORIGINS: Permitted frontend origins (default: http://localhost:3000)
#
# 2. Frontend Service (Next.js 16):
#    Location: web/.env.local
#    Template: web/.env.example
#    Quick start:
#      cd web
#      copy .env.example .env.local    # On Linux/macOS: cp .env.example .env.local
#    Key variables:
#      - NEXT_PUBLIC_CARTO_API_KEY: Optional CARTO basemap tiles key
#      - NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL: Backend URL (default: http://localhost:8000)
#
# NOTE: Never commit active .env or .env.local files containing real credentials to Git.
# Both are strictly ignored by root and subfolder .gitignore rules.
# =============================================================================
